    - time: 15.224
      text: Each piece unites practical resilience with meticulous traditional craftsmanship.
  - key: penutup
    title:
      id: Warisan yang Terus Lestari
      en: A Living Cultural Legacy
    text:
      id: Kini Golok Betawi kembali disarungkan dengan rapi. Melalui sanggar pencak
        silat, Museum Betawi di Setu Babakan, dan para pandai besi penerusnya, warisan
        leluhur Jakarta ini terus dijaga agar tetap hidup lintas generasi.
      en: Now the Golok Betawi returns neatly to its sheath. Through silat schools,
        the Betawi Museum at Setu Babakan, and dedicated local smiths, this ancestral
        craft of Jakarta continues to thrive across generations.
    stage: 0
    focusHotspot: 
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e63893a204944d14f8e25943a76b923d, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 849f592547db40649b076cf1cce893ea, type: 3}
    cuesID:
    - time: 0
      text: Kini Golok Betawi kembali disarungkan dengan rapi.
    - time: 4.312
      text: Melalui sanggar pencak silat, Museum Betawi di Setu Babakan, dan para
        pandai besi penerusnya, warisan leluhur Jakarta ini terus dijaga agar tetap
        hidup lintas generasi.
    cuesEN:
    - time: 0
      text: Now the Golok Betawi returns neatly to its sheath.
    - time: 4.168
      text: Through silat schools, the Betawi Museum at Setu Babakan, and dedicated
        local smiths, this ancestral craft of Jakarta continues to thrive across
        generations.
